
			Medusa Authorization Server
				Constable

RCS: $Id: README,v 1.3 2002/12/06 17:59:17 anonymous Exp $

What you need:

	1) Installed Medusa DS9 kernel patch.
	2) Installed libmcompiler-1.0 or later.
		http://terminus.sk/~marek/prog/libmcompiler.shtml (slovak language)
		http://terminus.sk/~marek/prog/libmcompiler-1.0.tgz (C language ;-)

Configuration:

	Edit Makefile

Compilation:

	make

The historical force-code add-on is not part of the supported build. Its
Linux-2.x mini-libc depends on removed syscall wrappers and 32-bit `vm86`
headers, so `make addon` does not build on the supported modern 64-bit Linux
toolchain. Its formatter is retained as bounded, independently tested
reference code while Phase 4 decides whether to port or retire the add-on.

Installation:

	make install

Help:

	constable -h

Documentation:

	Now only in Slovak language. File Dokumentacia.

